                "readOnlyHint": false
              },
              "description": "Construct a new supported graph with an exact-root XAXEDIT1 typed mutation carrier. Native XAX applies and verifies the staged candidate before publication. The record is hexadecimal transport; canonical semantic state is source. JSON xax-construct-v1 is unsupported.",
